@startuml
!theme mars
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Pengguna" as User
boundary "Halaman Login" as UI
boundary "Dashboard" as Dash
control "Sistem" as System
database "DB Users" as DB

== Proses Login ==

User -> UI : Mengakses halaman login
activate UI
UI -> UI : Validasi format input
User -> UI : Input email & password
UI -> System : Kirim permintaan login\n(POST /auth/login)
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> DB : Cari pengguna berdasarkan email
activate DB
DB --> System : Kembalikan data pengguna
deactivate DB

alt Pengguna Ditemukan & Password Valid
    System -> System : Verifikasi kredensial\n(bcrypt)
    System -> System : Generate JWT Token
    System -> DB : Perbarui last_login
    activate DB
    DB --> System : Pembaruan berhasil
    deactivate DB

    System --> UI : Kembalikan token & data user
    deactivate System
    activate UI

    UI -> Dash : Redirect ke Dashboard\n+ Bearer Token
    deactivate UI
    activate Dash

    Dash --> User : Tampilkan Dashboard
    deactivate Dash

else Pengguna Tidak Ditemukan
    System --> UI : Error: Email tidak terdaftar
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> User : Tampilkan pesan error
    deactivate UI

else Password Salah
    System --> UI : Error: Password salah
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> User : Tampilkan pesan error
    deactivate UI

else Akun Non-Aktif
    System --> UI : Error: Akun dinonaktifkan
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> User : Tampilkan pesan error
    deactivate UI
end

note right of User
  Berlaku untuk Admin, Teknisi,
  dan Customer Portal.
  Password diverifikasi dengan bcrypt.
  Token JWT disimpan di localStorage.
end note

@enduml